      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T00:32:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This basically is the same logic I raised a concern about in patchset 4. It disables the fail-safe mechanism of EC. It means we\u0027ll be forced to always trust DPTF unconditionally.\n\nMy understand is that we let the EC control the fan during boot and let DPTF control the fan while the OS is running but we should keep the fail-safe mechanism (e.g. chipset_force_shutdown) always enabled. Fan control and the fail-safe are orthogonal.\n\nDo you see any problem or conflict between the fail-safe and DPTF?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 164,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 164,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "2867cf99fc6d139959e8b9bab2965401d2b08e7e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
